   "widgets_values": [
    "PowerShard Image: модель шардируется по GPU (FSDP2), forward — родной код ComfyUI. parallel=auto: Flux / Qwen-Image / Z-Image / MOSS-Image — токены картинки по GPU (sequence), остальные (SDXL) — строки batch (cond/uncond) по GPU.\nEN: the model is sharded across GPUs; parallel=auto splits image tokens (sequence) for Flux / Qwen-Image / Z-Image / MOSS-Image and batch rows for other models (SDXL)."
